Hell hath no fury like a woman scorned Even a dog can distinguish =
between being stumbled over and being kicked Many a true word is spoken =
in jest Hope springs eternal --Alexander Pope, An Essay on Man

It's no use crying over spilt milk If ignorance is bliss, why aren't =
more people happy? Too many chiefs and not enough indians Definition: A =
situation almost impossible to complete
All things come to he who waits Possible Interpretation: One can get =
more cooperation from others by being nice Do unto others as you would =
have done to you
Same shit, different day abbreviated SSDD When the cat's away, the mice =
will play Variant attributed to Hugh Hefner: "No nudes is bad nudes" =
People who live in glass houses shouldn't play golf
Great minds think alike, but insanity speaks all languages - John Parry =
Idle hands are the devil's playthings Variant: No man can serve two =
masters, let alone mistresses No time to waste like the present
Talk is cheap You can't take it with you Possible Interpretation: You =
cannot explain what some people like The road to hell is paved with good =
intentions
Haste makes waste Ben Franklin A woman's work is never done Possible =
Interpretation: Do not look for faults in a something recieved as a gift =
A whistling woman and a crowing hen are neither fit for God nor man
Brain is better than brawn Don't throw out the baby with the bathwater A =
good man in an evil society seems the greatest villain of all Never say =
die
Hard cases make bad law No crows, no cares Live and let die The problem =
